vtime
args /playseed 3
# m46: easteregg6 from bossmode (the ` key, then '7' with the button held: intro3 with an
# explosion per click until a key, then halt(3)). The press and the 7 come together as the
# first poll of bossmode's wait loop (its key test goes first, so the button stays unread)
# vbls 40000
wait 3000
key #27
wait 2000
key `
press 160 100
key 7
wait 3000
shot Z1
click 100 100
wait 500
click 200 150
wait 500
shot Z2
key x
wait 3000
quit
